#2786
The River Tampaqui~
The rapids have ended and the surface is now safe.  The humidity's drag is
lessened with the quick bath in the river.  The river returns to its gentle
movement and it would be impossible to tell that only a few breaths away, the
river was a twisting leviathan of water and undertow.
~
